---
import Layout from "../layouts/Main.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Membership - Dover & District Beekeepers' Association"
  description="Join the DDBKA to enjoy benefits like insurance, monthly meetings, and a supportive community of beekeepers."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <!-- Page Header -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-amber-600 mb-6">
        Join Our Association
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-200 leading-relaxed">
        Become part of our thriving beekeeping community and enjoy the many
        benefits of membership.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Benefits Section -->
    <div
      class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 mb-12"
    >
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-600 mb-6">Why Join DDBKA?</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        There are a number of benefits to membership:
      </p>
      <ul class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <li class="flex items-start">
          <span class="text-amber-600 mr-3 text-xl">✓</span>
          <span class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
            Membership to the British Beekeepers' Association and Bee Disease
            Insurance cover
          </span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start">
          <span class="text-amber-600 mr-3 text-xl">✓</span>
          <span class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"
            >Mentoring and support</span
          >
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start">
          <span class="text-amber-600 mr-3 text-xl">✓</span>
          <span class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
            Comprehensive training with recognised qualifications
          </span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start">
          <span class="text-amber-600 mr-3 text-xl">✓</span>
          <span class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"
            >Monthly club meetings</span
          >
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start">
          <span class="text-amber-600 mr-3 text-xl">✓</span>
          <span class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"
            >Access to a well-stocked library</span
          >
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start">
          <span class="text-amber-600 mr-3 text-xl">✓</span>
          <span class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"
            >Discounts on supplies for members</span
          >
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start">
          <span class="text-amber-600 mr-3 text-xl">✓</span>
          <span class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"
            >Opportunities to use loan equipment</span
          >
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start">
          <span class="text-amber-600 mr-3 text-xl">✓</span>
          <span class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">Friendly</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Membership Form Section -->
    <div
      class="bg-amber-50 dark:bg-gray-800 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-amber-100 dark:border-gray-700 mb-12"
    >
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-600 mb-4">Ready to Join?</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        Complete our online membership form or download the printable membership
        form to get started. If downloaded, once completed please send it to us
        via email or bring it to one of our monthly meetings.
      </p>
      <p>
        <!--
        <a
          href="/subscription-form"
          class="inline-block px-8 py-3 mr-4 bg-amber-600 text-white font-semibold rounded-lg shadow-md hover:bg-amber-700 transition-colors"
        >
          Online membership form
        </a>
        -->
        <a
          href="/subscription-form.pdf"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-block px-8 py-3 bg-amber-600 text-white font-semibold rounded-lg shadow-md hover:bg-amber-700 transition-colors"
        >
          Membership form
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div
      class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 mb-12"
    >
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-600 mb-4">Insurance</h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-200 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        A copy of the insurance certificate can be used as proof of cover if
        members are asked for it by an event organiser. This overview appears in
        the schedule and can be provided as evidence to event organisers. A
        member can easily download the full schedule from the BBKA Members hub
        /admin and /insurance sections.
      </p>

      <div
        class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 mb-12"
      >
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-600 mb-6">
          Areas covered by the third party insurance provider through BBKA (up
          to £10 000 000 with a £500 excess payable under certain
          circumstances.)
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
          Provision of publications, education and assessment programmes,
          telephone support and research on bee-keeping and related issues.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-4">
          Promotion of bee-keeping and education of the public about bee-keeping
          and the importance of bees in the environment (at events, online and
          by members) and ordinary bee-keeping activities, manufacture & supply
          of primary hive products, including bee health advice.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-4">
          They are also involved as the authority on honey bees, and accordingly
          are called upon to work in a wide variety of places, from schools to
          prisons, advise the public, move swarms and any other activities as
          required, including advising DEFRA and trapping, freezing and
          identification of Asian hornets.
        </p>
        <p>
          BBKA will be present when the NBU are involved in destroying nests.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mb-12">
        <a
          href="/insurance-faqs.pdf"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="px-8 py-3 bg-amber-600 text-white font-semibold rounded-lg shadow-md hover:bg-amber-700 transition-colors mb-4"
          >BBKA Insurance FAQ's</a
        >
      </div>

      <div
        class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 mb-12"
      >
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-600 mb-6">
          Bee Diseases Insurance
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
          BDI is an organisation seperate to the BBKA, made up of Member
          Associations. The minimum payable by each Member Association to BDI
          Ltd, as a condition of Membership, is £2 per annum for each of its
          beekeeping members which insures 1-3 colonies.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-4">
          BDI should not be confused with the insurance provided by the BBKA as
          part of its registered membership package.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-4">
          BDI insurance becomes effective each year from the time that the
          member's association receives his or her membership subscription and
          any additional BDI premium is received. Premiums are paid in respect
          of the calendar year, 1st January to 31st December, irrespective of
          the date on which they are actually paid. However, cover will not
          commence until 40 days have elapsed from the payment of the premium,
          where such payment is made after the 31st March. This is known as the
          40-day rule.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-4">
          Beekeeping members can insure more colonies for an additional premium
          and you should consult your Association Treasurer, or the designated
          Association member who deals with BDI subscriptions to make any
          change.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-4">
          Direct members of the BBKA wanting to increase their BDI insurance
          cover should contact: <a href="mailto:members@bbka.org.uk"
            >members@bbka.org.uk</a
          >
        </p>
        <p class="mb-4">
          To find out more about BDI Ltd, including premiums for additional
          colonies, please visit their website: <a
            href="https://www.beediseasesinsurance.co.uk/"
            target="_blank">Bee Diseases Insurance</a
          >
        </p>
        <p>
          BDI Insurance only covers England and Wales. (Scotland and Northern
          Ireland have differing levels of inspection, which are not under the
          juristiction of DEFRA)
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <a
          href="/ylah.pdf"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="px-8 py-3 bg-amber-600 text-white font-semibold rounded-lg shadow-md hover:bg-amber-700 transition-colors mb-4"
          >YLAH - BBKA Trapping and Monitoring guidelines</a
        >
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Contact Section -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <!-- Get in Touch -->
      <div
        class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700"
      >
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-600 mb-4">Have Questions?</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Would you like to find out more? Please get in touch and we'll be
          happy to answer any questions you may have.
        </p>
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="inline-block px-8 py-3 bg-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-700 text-white font-semibold rounded-lg shadow-md hover:bg-gray-900 dark:hover:bg-gray-600 transition-colors"
        >
          Contact Us
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Email -->
      <div
        class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700"
      >
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-600 mb-4">Email Us</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          You can also reach us directly via email:
        </p>
        <a
          href="mailto:enquiries@ddbka.co.uk"
          class="text-amber-600 font-semibold hover:underline break-all"
        >
          enquiries@ddbka.co.uk
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
